1
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:20,440
我最爱的美女好啊
There is my favorite girl!

2
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,610
我好激动可以周末一起去做水疗哦
I'm so excited about our SPA weekend!

3
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:23,650
我也是
Oh, me too.

4
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,790
如果你们到了那边还记得的话
If you think of it while you're there,

5
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,750
我的防晒粉马上就不够用了
I'm dangerously low on sunscreen powder.

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:27,610
粉
Powder?

7
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:29,411
等十年后 你的脸变成老苹果的时候
You know, you won't be smirking 10 years from now

8
00:00:29,411 --> 00:00:31,291
你就笑不出来了
when your face looks like an old apple.

9
00:00:31,791 --> 00:00:34,951
我首次得到出任普里契特橱柜CEO的奖励
I just got my first perk as C.E.O. Of Pritchett's Closets.

10
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,040
我承包的水疗馆项目完成了
I finished a big job for a spa,

11
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:37,920
他们为了感谢我
and as a thank-you,

12
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,940
给了我两个免费水疗周末的名额
they sent me a free weekend for two.

13
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,700
但菲尔太怕痒了 不能接受按摩
Phil's too ticklish for massages, though.

14
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,200
可我不会
But I am not!

15
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,800
我听说好多明星都去那里
I heard it's the place where all the stars go

16
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,340
往脸上倒热泥巴
to get hot mud poured into their faces.

17
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,080
我只是等不及要看这位的素颜了
I just can't wait to see this one without makeup.

18
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:57,220
如果你看到了 那将是你死前见到的最后画面
You do, it will be the last thing that you will ever see.

19
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:01,940
我还记得我第一次获得的工作奖励
I remember my first big perk for a job well-done.

20
00:01:02,172 --> 00:01:05,403
我给《家有阿福》的主创升级了柜子
I had upgraded some closets for guy who created "ALF".

21
00:01:05,403 --> 00:01:07,313
六周以后 我看节目里
And six weeks later, I'm watching the show.

22
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,160
阿福狂骂的一个帅哥邮递员
There's ALF sassing this handsome mailman

23
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,420
就叫杰·普里契特
named Jay Pritchett.

24
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,980
我还录下来了呢
I still got it on Betamax.

25
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:15,420
我记得 我们第一次约会时你就给我看过
I remember. You showed it to me on our first date.

26
00:01:18,213 --> 00:01:20,884
杰 准备好一起去看拳击比赛了吗
Jay, you ready to watch the, uh, fight together?

27
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:21,400
好啊
Yep.

28
00:01:22,684 --> 00:01:23,834
就我们两个
Just two of us.

29
00:01:24,684 --> 00:01:26,134
我本来把今天晚上都计划好了
I had the perfect night planned --

30
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,280
我一个人 付费观看拳击比赛
alone, pay-per-view boxing --

31
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,640
爱尔兰的骄傲[酒]对战古巴的轰动[雪茄]
The pride of Ireland versus a Cuban sensation.

32
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:33,280
在拳击场里 也在我的血液里
In the ring and in my bloodstream.

33
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:36,380
结果歌洛莉亚和米奇尔掺和进来了
Then Gloria and Mitchell got involved.

34
00:01:36,895 --> 00:01:39,795
杰 小卡也要看拳击赛
Jay, Cam is gonna watch the fight, too.

35
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,320
你们何不一起看呢
Why don't you two watch it together?

36
00:01:41,495 --> 00:01:44,245
太好了 不然小卡只能一个人去酒吧看了
Oh, good, because Cam was just gonna watch from a bar by himself.

37
00:01:44,245 --> 00:01:46,555
我好喜欢 简直像你们俩来了场约会
I love it. It's gonna be like you have a date!

38
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:49,420
我不知道怎么回事 但每次我和杰独处
I don't know what it is, but Jay gets uncomfortable

39
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,120
他都会觉得不自在
when it's just the two of us.

40
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:53,920
然后害我也觉得不自在
And then I get uncomfortable,

41
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,000
总感觉有必要说点什么
and I feel like I have to say something.

42
00:01:56,116 --> 00:01:57,646
完美
Perfect.

43
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,820
今天是希特勒的生日
Today's Hitler's birthday.

44
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:06,400
米奇尔 我们走了
Mitchell, we're going!

45
00:02:07,146 --> 00:02:09,126
菲尔人呢 电影院里的座位肯定坐满了
Where is Phil? The theater's gonna be packed.

46
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:11,400
亲爱的 你的书呆子朋友在等你
Honey, your nerd friend is waiting.

47
00:02:12,647 --> 00:02:14,997
谁敢召唤我的大名
Who dare invoke my name?

48
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:15,780
撤退信号来了
That's my cue.

49
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:17,760
是我 你的毁灭者
It is I, your destroyer!

50
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,800
莉莉 你确定不跟我们一起去看电影吗
Lily, you sure you don't want to go to the movies with us?

51
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,320
最后问你一次哦
Last chance.

52
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,660
讲什么的来着
What is it about again?

53
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,180
《无限的守护者们》讲述的是
The Defenders of Infinity are heroes

54
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,780
从几个不同时间流来的英雄
from several different time streams

55
00:02:26,847 --> 00:02:28,168
一不小心进入了未来 但却不知道...
that make their way into the future without --

56
00:02:28,168 --> 00:02:29,818
并不是真的未来
Um, it's not really the future

57
00:02:29,818 --> 00:02:31,668
因为时间流都是共存的
since the streams have always coexisted.

58
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:34,000
不要这样 别把我当成"脑叶人"
Don't do that. Don't treat me like I'm a lobotomorph.

59
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:35,200
莉莉 你不会想去的
Lily, you don't want to go.

60
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:36,340
你将会是全影院唯一的女孩
You'll be the only girl in the theater.

61
00:02:36,668 --> 00:02:38,108
好了 你们该走了
All right, you guys should head out.

62
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:39,040
我们很想走了
We would love to.

63
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,720
不用担心
Oh, and don't worry.

64
00:02:40,938 --> 00:02:43,318
莉莉的保姆把今晚计划得满满的
Lily's babysitters have a big night planned --

65
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:45,940
拼图 乒乓球 桌游
puzzles, ping-pong, board games.

66
00:02:46,069 --> 00:02:48,829
现在还是"让曼尼赢吧 不然他该哭了"计划吗
Are we still in that "Let Manny win or he cries" Phase?

67
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:49,340
不是
No.

68
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:51,480
我们该走了 我们要不要通过不同时间流走
We should get going. Are we taking separate time streams?

69
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,840
当然 如果我们想昨天到达的话
Sure, if we want to get there yesterday.

70
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:12,540
这一盆绿苹果 可真让人放松
Ah, there's something so relaxing about a bowl of green apples.

71
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,600
我已经把烦恼都忘掉了
I already forgot all my problems.

72
00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:17,760
你听到了吗
Did you hear that?

73
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,360
-什么 -就是啊
- What? - Exactly.

74
00:03:19,681 --> 00:03:23,261
我们在所有抽屉上都用了静音滑道
We used WhisperQuiet gliders in all the drawers.

75
00:03:23,361 --> 00:03:25,121
减少了不少"柜噪"
Oh, really cuts down on C.N.

76
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:27,280
那是我们这行的术语 意思是"柜子噪音"
It's industry jargon for "Closet noise."

77
00:03:27,701 --> 00:03:30,011
这个降噪技术能用到人身上吗
Does that technology work on people, too?

78
00:03:30,011 --> 00:03:33,151
你说得对 我保证不会再三句话不离本行了
You're right. I promise -- No more shop talk.

79
00:03:33,431 --> 00:03:34,672
是谁啊
What is this?

80
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,680
家里的烟雾警报响了
Our smoke alarm went off at home.

81
00:03:37,302 --> 00:03:38,262
我相信不是什么大事
I'm sure it's nothing,

82
00:03:38,262 --> 00:03:41,392
还是给卢克打个电话确认一下吧
but I'm still gonna call Luke just in case.

83
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:42,880
直接转到语音信箱了
And it's straight to voicemail.

84
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:45,900
曼尼 我们看到烟雾警报响了
Hello, Manny. We saw that the smoke alarm went off.

85
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:46,540
你没事吧
Are you okay?

86
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,500
天啊 卢克的留言信息是
Oh, God. Luke's outgoing message

87
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:50,580
又长又稍稍有点性别歧视的说唱
is a long and vaguely sexist rap.

88
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:52,900
好的 宝贝 保持优秀
Okay, Papi. Stay perfect!

89
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:54,720
一切都好
Everything is okay.

90
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:57,020
他们在烤饼干呢 结果烤糊了一批
They were baking cookies and they burned a batch.

91
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,320
好吧
All right.

92
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,060
不过我们家烤箱明明是坏的
Except our oven isn't working.

93
00:04:01,243 --> 00:04:03,533
曼尼从来不撒谎的 不如这样吧
Manny would never lie. You know what?

94
00:04:03,533 --> 00:04:06,083
我打电话叫个俄国按摩师
I am gonna call for a Russian masseuse.

95
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:08,240
他们的手非常有劲儿 都是拧衣服练出来的
Their hands are very strong from wringing laundry.

96
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:10,080
你考虑一下
Think about it.

97
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:12,200
他们当时急着赶我们出家门
They were very eager to get us out of the house.

98
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,500
他们肯定有什么阴谋
They're up to something.

99
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:14,760
你疑心太重了
You are too suspicious.

100
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,560
你太轻信别人了
And you are too trusting!

101
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,460
今年卢克已经被警察抓过
Luke's already been arrested this year.

102
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,340
几周前 他喝啤酒还被我们撞见
A few weeks ago, we caught him with beer.

103
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:22,120
我刚刚的说唱都比他好
Even that's a better rap.

104
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:25,040
我听到卢克的名字好几次 却没提过曼尼
I'm hearing a lot of Luke's name and none of Manny.

105
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:26,780
你觉得曼尼不会趁你不注意的时候
You don't think Manny's up to the same things

106
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:27,740
也在一起搞鬼吗
when you're not paying attention?

107
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:29,680
你疯了 曼尼讨厌啤酒
You're crazy. Manny hates beer.

108
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,240
那就是果香博若莱红葡萄酒
A fruity Beaujolais then.

109
00:04:31,245 --> 00:04:32,185
你想干嘛就干嘛
You can do whatever you want.

110
00:04:32,185 --> 00:04:33,895
我去看看我家孩子
I'm gonna go check on my kid.

111
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:43,400
我好讨厌这些滑道 都没法摔出点气势
I hate how good those gliders are!

112
00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:50,880
我好兴奋 感觉自己像个小少年
I am so excited. I feel like a teenager.

113
00:04:50,886 --> 00:04:53,076
我也是 但是作为古人托尔夫的我
Me too. Although, as Torf the Ancient,

114
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:56,260
已经从巨星爆炸到七月联盟中
I have seen everything from the Great Star Explosion

115
00:04:56,276 --> 00:04:57,666
阅尽世间万物了
to the Seven Moon Alliance.

116
00:04:57,666 --> 00:04:59,417
克莱尔说对了 没有姑娘
Claire was right. No girls.

117
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,040
菲尔
Phil?

118
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:01,760
詹姆斯
James!

119
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:02,680
你好呀
What's up?

120
00:05:03,427 --> 00:05:05,657
我去年卖给这位酷哥一栋山间小屋
I sold this cool cat a house in the hills last year.

121
00:05:05,657 --> 00:05:07,927
从那以后 他的青草地乡村乐队就飞黄腾达了
Since then, his bluegrass band has really taken off.

122
00:05:07,927 --> 00:05:09,817
特别疯狂 我们开始是想讽刺才搞乐队
It's so crazy. We started doing it ironically,

123
00:05:09,817 --> 00:05:11,917
结果不知不觉的 竟然真的做起来了
and before we knew it, we were actually doing it for real.

124
00:05:11,917 --> 00:05:13,687
90年代的时候 我也经历过
That happened to me in the '90s

125
00:05:13,687 --> 00:05:14,567
想说"抱歉" 结果真被"抱"了
with saying, "Exsqueeze me."

126
00:05:15,377 --> 00:05:18,278
从你的古人托尔夫造型
Well, I assume from your Torf the Ancient costume,

127
00:05:18,278 --> 00:05:20,458
-和你的苍白奴隶造型中看出来 -我这不是造型
- and your pale slave getup... - Not a costume.

128
00:05:20,458 --> 00:05:23,138
你们是来看《无限的守护者们》的
hat you guys are here to see "Defenders of Infinity."

129
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:23,860
没错
Oh, yeah!

130
00:05:23,998 --> 00:05:25,178
超级好看
Oh, it is so incredible!

131
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,220
-真的吗 -真的
- Really? - Yeah.

132
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:28,140
对了 你们想感受彻底震撼的话
Hey, if you really want to be blown away,

133
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:30,540
我这有两颗特质小熊软糖可以给你们吃
I've got two special gummy bears you can have.

134
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,400
我们一人就一颗吗
Just one for each of us?

135
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,960
相信我 一颗就够了
Believe me. One is all you need.

136
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:36,000
我们可以去小卖部再买点
I guess we can get more at the concession stand.

137
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:38,560
不 他们可不卖这种橡皮糖
No, they don't sell gummy bears like these here.

138
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:43,240
你是从欧洲带回来特别酷的对吧
You get extra cool ones from Europe or something.

139
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,260
你们怎么还没明白 这是大麻
Guys, how are you not getting this? It's pot.

140
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:52,280
我也不知道为什么 反正我从来没抽过大麻
I don't know why, but I've never tried marijuana.

141
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:53,420
对 我也没有
No. No, me neither.

142
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:56,110
总有些什么事阻拦我
Th-There was always something stopping me --

143
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:57,700
比如要照顾莉莉啦
needing to take care of Lily,

144
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,200
花样滑冰荣誉准则啦
the figure-skating honor code,

145
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:02,280
不想吸得神志不清 在高中意外出柜啦
not wanting to accidentally tell everyone in high school I was gay.

146
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,680
从来没人递给我抽过 挺奇怪的
People never offered it to me, which is weird

147
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:07,200
因为在大学里我也算是有头有脸的人物
because in college, I was kind of a big man on campus.

148
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,280
我建立了一个大型组织
I founded a major organization --

149
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:12,440
全国负责任的拉拉队员协会
the National Association of Responsible Cheerleaders.

150
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:14,580
-缩写是NARCs[缉毒署] -是啊
- Uh, NARCs. - Yeah.

151
00:06:16,260 --> 00:06:18,460
来 这个要45分钟才起效
Here. They take 45 minutes to hit,

152
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:19,380
现在就吃
so take them now,

153
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:20,960
等电影开始 你们的状态就刚刚好
and you'll be good to go when the movie starts.

154
00:06:21,151 --> 00:06:22,041
好
Okay.

155
00:06:23,632 --> 00:06:27,132
如果我们想尝试这个
Um, you know, if -- if we ever were gonna try this,

156
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:29,200
今晚也算是个完美时机
tonight's kind of the perfect opportunity.

157
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,240
我觉得你说得对
I guess you're right.

158
00:06:30,942 --> 00:06:33,592
不用带孩子 穿的是尼龙扣运动鞋
No kids. I'm wearing Velcro sneakers.

159
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,740
要吗
Should we?

160
00:06:35,292 --> 00:06:36,922
我一直都想知道那是什么感觉
I've always wanted to know what it would be like.

161
00:06:36,940 --> 00:06:38,940
再说了 我今天去了健身房
Plus, I went to the gym today.

162
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:40,500
我理应尝点甜头
I deserve a sweet.

163
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,040
-那就来吧 -好
- Let's do it. - Okay.

164
00:06:42,893 --> 00:06:44,483
我在发抖 谢谢你
I'm shaking. Thank you.

165
00:06:46,533 --> 00:06:47,763
-干杯 -干杯
- Cheers. - Cheersies.

166
00:06:51,113 --> 00:06:52,143
慢点嚼
Chew smaller.

167
00:06:54,113 --> 00:06:54,983
好啊
'Sup?

168
00:06:58,374 --> 00:06:59,344
我的天
Oh, my God.

169
00:06:59,344 --> 00:07:02,164
不敢相信我们居然真吃了 太刺激了
I cannot believe we're doing this. This is so exciting.

170
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,840
天啊 我就知道犯了个大错
Oh, God. I knew this was a horrible mistake.

171
00:07:04,034 --> 00:07:06,884
我收到一个警报 烟雾警报器被触发了
I just got an alert. Our smoke alarm when off!

172
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,180
吐不出来
It's not coming up.

173
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:11,860
没事
Okay, okay.

174
00:07:12,764 --> 00:07:14,565
放松 我现在打给卢克
Relax. I'm gonna -- I'm gonna call Luke,

175
00:07:14,565 --> 00:07:15,975
-看看怎么回事 -好
- find out what's up. - Yeah.

176
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:19,260
转进语音信箱了
Voicemail.

177
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,780
不过这段说唱还挺搞笑的
This rap's hilarious, though.

178
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:24,680
-打给克莱尔 -她不在家
-Call Claire. -She's not home.

179
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:25,800
我们得回去看看
We're gonna have to check this out.

180
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,980
不 拜托 这种警报一般都没什么事
No, come on. Those alerts are always nothing.

181
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:30,440
再说了 我们的犯罪事实
Plus... our crime.

182
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:32,840
听着 我们的座位是有号的
Listen, we have assigned seats

183
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:35,040
这个也要45分钟才起效
and 45 minutes till this kicks in.

184
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,760
我们完全有时间打车回家
That gives us plenty of time to Uber home,

185
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,880
确保一切安好
make sure everything's fine,

186
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:39,360
平复下我的心情 然后再回来
touch up my veins, and get back.

187
00:07:39,366 --> 00:07:41,966
我设个闹钟 这样就知道什么时候起效
I'll set an alarm so we know exactly when it hits.

188
00:07:41,966 --> 00:07:44,016
你说得对 莉莉也在呢 我们走吧
No, you're right. Lily's there. Yes, yes. Let's go.

189
00:07:44,016 --> 00:07:45,376
再说了 我们不会想等到飘飘欲仙的时候
Plus, we're not gonna want to deal with this

190
00:07:45,376 --> 00:07:46,916
再来处理这种事的
when we're high and paranoid.

191
00:07:46,926 --> 00:07:47,857
天啊
Oh, God.

192
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,420
你觉得到飘飘欲仙的状况会很严重吗
Do you think the paranoia will be bad?

193
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,500
你的衣柜生意如何
So, how's the closet business?

194
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:01,040
-我两个月前退休了 -对哦 对哦
- I retired two months ago. - Right. Right.

195
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:06,460
我下个月打算清洗一下地毯
Uh, getting our carpets cleaned next month.

196
00:08:09,220 --> 00:08:11,060
拜托 简直荒谬
Oh, come on. That's ridiculous.

197
00:08:11,148 --> 00:08:13,008
赫南德兹绝对轻松拿下这场比赛
Hernandez has this fight in the bag.

198
00:08:13,018 --> 00:08:14,008
是啊 简直是易如反掌
Yeah, it's gonna be such a cakewalk.

199
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:15,380
根本就不该给他钱
He shouldn't even be getting paid for it.

200
00:08:15,558 --> 00:08:16,248
这些人简直胡扯
Can you believe these guys?

201
00:08:16,488 --> 00:08:19,738
无意冒犯 可就算奥布莱恩有那么半点清醒
No disrespect, but if O'Brien's even halfway sober,

202
00:08:19,738 --> 00:08:21,128
都能把赫南德兹撕碎
he takes Hernandez apart.

203
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,680
对 他臂展更长 出拳更猛
Yeah, he's got a better reach, better jab,

204
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,860
脚步之灵活迅速堪比踢踏舞
and I haven't seen feet that fast since Riverdance.

205
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:26,380
你们看起来还挺自信
You guys seem pretty confident.

206
00:08:26,409 --> 00:08:28,689
要不小小地赌个十美元如何
Uh, care to make a friendly $10 bet?

207
00:08:28,699 --> 00:08:30,249
我们应战 简直是这辈子挣的最轻松的钱
We'll take it. Easiest money I ever made.

208
00:08:30,249 --> 00:08:31,909
你们简直疯了 奥布莱恩是个废物
You're crazy. O'Brien is a mook.

209
00:08:31,909 --> 00:08:33,189
赫南德兹就是个半吊子
Well, Hernandez is a palooka.

210
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:35,000
我宁愿是个半吊子也不愿意是个废物
I'd rather be a palooka than a mook.

211
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:37,660
两个傻屌也好意思说这种话
Well, that's a lot of talk coming from a couple jabronis.

212
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:42,940
小卡 淡定 我们这是说着玩呢
Cam, calm down. We're just having fun here.

213
00:08:43,060 --> 00:08:44,940
不是吧 那个词已经很过分了吗
Really? That's -- That's the line?

214
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,640
怎么回事
What happened?

215
00:08:48,710 --> 00:08:50,720
该死 奥布莱恩把他击倒了
Damn it! O'Brien knocked him out!

216
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,960
这么快 我们完全错过了
Already? We missed the whole thing!

217
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,040
厨房很忙
We're backed up in the kitchen.

218
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:55,680
抱歉了 你们点的餐还要再等会
Sorry, guys. Your food's gonna be a while.

219
00:08:58,220 --> 00:08:59,540
我想过要走
I thought about leaving,

220
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:01,320
可我不想让杰不高兴
but I didn't want to make Jay feel bad.

221
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,080
我在等一个三明治
I had a sandwich coming.

222
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:10,220
我就说吧 屁事都没有
I told you. Nothing!

223
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:13,160
我觉得像这么平静无事有点不正常
A little too much nothing, if you ask me.

224
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,600
你们怎么回来了
What are you guys doing here?

225
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,240
我忘了带拖鞋
I forgot my slippers.

226
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:21,880
酒店不是会有拖鞋吗
Doesn't the hotel have slippers?

227
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,120
我来问问题
I'll be asking the questions.

228
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,580
你们怎么可能把巧克力饼干烤糊
How did you manage to burn chocolate-chip cookies

229
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:26,820
烤箱明明都坏掉了
in an oven that doesn't work?

230
00:09:26,912 --> 00:09:29,012
曼尼的意思是煎饼
Oh, Manny meant pancakes.

231
00:09:29,012 --> 00:09:30,953
我们在做巧克力煎饼
We're making chocolate-chip pancakes.

232
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,620
瞧吧 我们走吧
You see? Now, let's go.

233
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:40,620
这会应该有按摩师往我身上撒盐才对
Somebody named Olga should be salting me like a pretzel!

234
00:09:46,234 --> 00:09:47,014
没什么事吧
Is everything okay?

235
00:09:47,014 --> 00:09:48,944
没事 警报误响了
Oh, yes. It was just a false alarm.

236
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,420
那我们就回电影院去了
Well, then we should probably get back to the theater.

237
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,900
开映前的趣味问题
Those pre-movie trivia questions

238
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:53,340
还等着我们去回答呢
aren't gonna answer themselves, are they?

239
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,380
-其实是自问自答 -等一下
- Actually, they do. - Wait a minute!

240
00:09:56,980 --> 00:10:00,140
这是怎么回事
What the hell is going on...

241
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,500
这个东西
here, huh?

242
00:10:03,620 --> 00:10:06,020
我闻到廉价啤酒味 有人在开派对
I smell cheap beer. Someone's been having a party.

243
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:08,120
克莱尔 你这是在发疯
Claire, you're just being crazy.

244
00:10:08,340 --> 00:10:10,600
你看一看周围 根本就没事
Take a look around! Nothing is going on!

245
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,680
没有什么派对
There is no party!

246
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,860
所有人都淡定
Everyone just be cool!

247
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:19,440
看过那个独臂高尔夫球员的故事吗
See that story about the one-armed golfer?

248
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:19,940
没有
No.

249
00:10:20,406 --> 00:10:23,226
就是 有这么个人...
Yeah, well, it's this guy and he's...

250
00:10:24,186 --> 00:10:26,886
就这样了 他是个独臂高尔夫球员
Well, I guess that's it. He's -- He's a one-armed golfer.

251
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:30,560
厨房到底是有多忙
How backed up is that kitchen?!

252
00:10:32,356 --> 00:10:32,876
这两个家伙
These guys!

253
00:10:32,876 --> 00:10:34,786
嘿 你们两个小鬼 过来
Hey, you rascals. Get over here.

254
00:10:34,786 --> 00:10:35,676
我们正准备走
We're on our way out.

255
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:37,727
别急 你们不想找机会把钱赢回来吗
No! Don't you want a chance to win your money back?

256
00:10:37,727 --> 00:10:39,027
每人5块钱而已 无所谓了
It's 5 bucks each. We're good.

257
00:10:39,140 --> 00:10:40,300
别啊 来吧
No! Come on!

258
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,360
会很好玩的
It'll be fun.

259
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:42,540
老兄 你把我胳膊抓痛了
Dude, you're hurting my arm.

260
00:10:42,567 --> 00:10:44,177
来一局桌上足球 要么赢回去要么输双倍
No, a game of foosball, double or nothing.

261
00:10:44,177 --> 00:10:46,927
-我不想... -说定了 走吧
- I don't think -- - You're on! Let's go!

262
00:10:47,517 --> 00:10:49,587
菲尔 我们还有多长时间
Phil, uh, how long do we have?

263
00:10:49,667 --> 00:10:50,877
17分钟
17 minutes.

264
00:10:50,877 --> 00:10:52,737
我们是指距离电影开始的时间
Till the movie, is what we're talking about.

265
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,380
我们就是两个看电影的人
We're just two guys seeing a movie.

266
00:10:54,660 --> 00:10:56,420
在把事情搞清楚前 任何人都不准离开
No one's leaving here until we get to the bottom of this.

267
00:10:56,580 --> 00:10:58,380
我的天 来个人给我按背
Oh, my God. Somebody give me a back rub!

268
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,260
曼尼 卢克 都过来
Manny! Luke! Get in here!

269
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:02,080
你们去搜查房子 看看有什么可疑之处
You guys go search the house. Find something suspicious.

270
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,780
这会不会跟塞洗碗机一样
Is this gonna be like loading the dishwasher?

271
00:11:03,878 --> 00:11:05,478
我先塞了一次 然后你又重新塞了一次
First I load it, then you reload it?

272
00:11:05,488 --> 00:11:06,408
如果你亲自...
Wouldn't it be faster if you actually...

273
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,340
菲尔 快去
Phil, go!

274
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,500
什么事这么重要
What's so important?

275
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,040
我在坐等我的肖像画呢
I'm sitting for my portrait.

276
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:13,060
少来这套 我知道你俩开了个派对
Oh, knock it off. I know you two threw a party.

277
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,780
我不开[扔]派对的 克莱尔
I don't "throw" a party, Claire.

278
00:11:14,819 --> 00:11:16,159
是真的 他什么东西都扔不动
It's true. He can't throw anything.

279
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:17,540
而且如果我真的举办了派对
And if I were hosting an event,

280
00:11:17,659 --> 00:11:19,069
我要把冰雕藏哪
where did I put the ice sculpture?

281
00:11:19,069 --> 00:11:20,829
把餐前点心藏哪
Where did I stash the hors d'oeuvres?

282
00:11:20,829 --> 00:11:22,549
把爵士三人乐队藏哪
Where did I hide the jazz trio?

283
00:11:22,549 --> 00:11:23,789
问得好
Good question,

284
00:11:23,789 --> 00:11:27,009
因为你连"独奏"的[啤酒]都藏不好
considering you couldn't even hide... the Solo.

285
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:28,280
文字游戏玩得不错 妈
Nice wordplay, Mom,

286
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:30,060
但那个杯子已经放那三天了
but that cup's been there for like three days.

287
00:11:30,530 --> 00:11:31,490
我之前什么都没说
I didn't want to say anything

288
00:11:31,490 --> 00:11:33,300
因为我以为那是你用过的
'cause I thought it was yours.

289
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:36,320
没错 那方法很大胆
Yeah. It was bold.

290
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,880
可楼上那些孩子不会一直保持安静
But those kids upstairs weren't gonna stay quiet forever.

291
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:42,780
只要一个人手机没电 就会有人说话
I was one dead phone battery away from a conversation breaking out.

292
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,640
当然了 开派对是很冒险
Sure, throwing a party was a risk,

293
00:11:46,700 --> 00:11:49,460
可我们学校刚来了两个超辣的交换留学生
but two hot exchange students just started at our school.

294
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,700
最妙的就是 她们还不知道
Best part is, they don't understand

295
00:11:51,700 --> 00:11:53,640
我们到底有多不酷
just how uncool we are.

296
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:54,340
暂时而已
Yet.

297
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:56,680
于是 我们在走廊里走着
So, we were walking down the hallway

298
00:11:56,741 --> 00:11:57,741
然后在储物柜旁停了下来
when we stopped by the locker --

299
00:11:57,741 --> 00:11:59,811
"披萨日"
Ohh, pizza day.

300
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,280
那是我们的私人教练
That's our personal trainer.

301
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,020
他不喜欢我们吃糖类食物
He hates it when we eat carbs.

302
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,420
我们的机遇期很短
We had a short window.

303
00:12:09,580 --> 00:12:11,260
我们必须尽快给她们留下好印象
We needed to impress them fast.

304
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,960
所以我们就用无限的汽水贿赂莉莉
So, we bribed Lily with all the soda she could drink

305
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,620
开了这场派对
and threw a party.

306
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:17,400
开始一切都很顺利 直到有人触发了火警
It was going great until someone set off the alarm

307
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,540
因为他非要抽那个傻帽烟斗
because he just had to smoke his dorky pipe.

308
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:20,360
傻帽
Dorky?

309
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:22,700
是啊 休·海夫纳抽烟斗就"泡不到"妞呢
Yeah, because Hugh Hefner doesn't get girls.

310
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,900
我也爱你 妈妈
I love you, too, Mommy.

311
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:28,720
没事了 朋友们
All clear, party people!

312
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,980
我告诉她我们在烤饼干
I told her we were baking cookies.

313
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,580
老兄 我家的烤箱坏了
Dude, our oven's broken.

314
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:37,160
我妈绝对会起疑心来查岗的
My mom's definitely gonna get suspicious and check on us.

315
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:38,500
那说明我妈也会来
That means my mom's coming, too.

316
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:39,840
我让大家快撤
I'll get everyone to leave,

317
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,760
你来处理啤酒和你的大餐
you get rid of the beer and your idea of a spread.

318
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,680
等等 我们不能放弃
Wait. We're not giving up yet.

319
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,560
啤酒乒乓球比赛才刚开始
The beer pong tournament just started,

320
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:48,440
姑娘们为我们讲的笑话笑个不停
the girls are laughing at all of our jokes,

321
00:12:48,884 --> 00:12:52,005
还以为我们跟汤米·卡特西那种家伙是朋友
and they think we're friends with guys like Tommy Cutahee.

322
00:12:52,205 --> 00:12:53,545
派对真棒 路易斯
Great party, Lewis.

323
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:54,540
谢了 汤米
Thanks, Tommy.

324
00:12:55,135 --> 00:12:56,315
从现在开始 我叫路易斯
From now on, I'm Lewis.

325
00:12:56,315 --> 00:12:58,005
如果不采取行动 我们会被抓到的
We're going to get caught if we do nothing.

326
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,360
要是我们把大家都藏起来
What if we hide everyone long enough

327
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:01,000
直到我妈检查完走了呢
for my mom to check on us and then leave?

328
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:02,280
这么做可不值
It's not worth it.

329
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:06,440
两位 我们什么时候玩《天堂七小时》
Guys, when do we play Seven Hours in Heaven?

330
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,260
派对转移到楼上啦 朋友们
Moving the party upstairs, people!

331
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:13,000
好了 这里没人
Okay. No one's here.

332
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:14,720
是你手表闹钟响了吗
Is that your watch alarm?

333
00:13:15,220 --> 00:13:16,260
我们得走了
We have to get out of here!

334
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:17,760
我可不想在克莱尔面前进入嗑高的状态
I do not want to be high in front of Claire!

335
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:18,240
等等
Wait.

336
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,440
我想我有感觉了
I think I'm feeling something.

337
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:21,440
不要啊
Oh, no.

338
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:23,320
你感觉怎么样
What are you feeling?

339
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:25,060
很好
Nice.

340
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,760
天啊
Oh, God.

341
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:27,960
你有感觉了吗
Are you feeling anything?

342
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,260
没有
No.

343
00:13:29,900 --> 00:13:31,380
那你怎么歪着站
Then why are you leaning like that?

344
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,200
我没歪啊
I'm not leaning.

345
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,800
也许是你站歪了 所以看着我是歪的
Maybe you're leaning so it looks like I'm leaning.

346
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,320
是啊 你说得对
Oh, yeah. You're right.

347
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,100
菲尔 你在干什么呢
Phil, what are you doing?

348
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,180
还在搜
Still searching!

349
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:44,360
有什么可疑的吗
Anything suspicious?

350
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:45,220
说"没有"[别说话]
Say nothing.

351
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:45,880
好的
Okay.

352
00:13:47,980 --> 00:13:48,400
菲尔
Phil?

353
00:13:49,100 --> 00:13:49,760
回答她啊
Answer her!

354
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:50,720
你刚刚叫我别说话
You said "Say nothing."

355
00:13:50,788 --> 00:13:52,818
-我是让你说"没有" -那个词
- I mean say the word "Nothing." - Word.

356
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,280
没有
Nothing!

357
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:00,000
-说的好棒 -谢谢 兄弟
- That was so good. - Thanks, man.

358
00:14:00,539 --> 00:14:02,509
好了 菲利普 集中精神
Okay, Phillip. Focus.

359
00:14:02,509 --> 00:14:04,489
我们得快点搜完这所房子
We have to finish searching this house

360
00:14:04,569 --> 00:14:06,669
以免待会儿表现得诡异或是...
before we start acting weird or...

361
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:10,260
没有
Nothing!

362
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:13,060
说得好棒
That was so great.

363
00:14:13,209 --> 00:14:14,809
当然 名师出高徒嘛
Yeah, I learned from the best.

364
00:14:16,170 --> 00:14:18,610
来吧 你这个混蛋 进球啊 混账
Come on, you jerk. Get in there, you son of a bitch!

365
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:20,590
对了 宝贝 就这样
Oh, yeah, baby. Here we go.

366
00:14:20,590 --> 00:14:21,830
昨晚我搞你妹的时候
That's what your sister said last night

367
00:14:21,860 --> 00:14:22,640
她就是这么说的
when I was banging her.

368
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:25,030
什么 该死的 维克
What?! Aw, damn it, Vic!

369
00:14:26,580 --> 00:14:29,260
小卡搞了维克的妹妹
Cam was banging Vic's sister.

370
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:31,620
太经典了
Classic!

371
00:14:36,511 --> 00:14:37,871
快点吧
Oh, just hit it already.

372
00:14:37,871 --> 00:14:40,591
昨晚小卡搞你妹的时候 她也是这么对他说的
That's what your sister said to Cam last night when he was banging her.

373
00:14:40,591 --> 00:14:41,451
我说得好笑吗
Did I do it?

374
00:14:41,451 --> 00:14:43,011
你真的好棒
You're so good!

375
00:14:43,951 --> 00:14:44,981
好棒
Yes!

376
00:14:47,340 --> 00:14:49,660
曼尼 曼尼 曼尼
Manny, Manny...Manny.

377
00:14:50,020 --> 00:14:51,520
怎么会这样呢
How did we get here?

378
00:14:52,180 --> 00:14:53,640
你是个好孩子
You're a good kid.

379
00:14:53,872 --> 00:14:55,432
你跟这事一点关系都没有
You didn't have anything to do with this.

380
00:14:55,432 --> 00:14:57,142
只是在错误的时间出现在错误的地点
You were in the wrong place at the wrong time.

381
00:14:57,260 --> 00:14:57,900
我说的对吗
Am I right?

382
00:14:58,420 --> 00:14:59,900
但是某人必须为这事接受惩罚
But someone's going down for this.

383
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:02,360
你觉得会是那个白人小孩吗
You think it'll be the white kid?

384
00:15:04,612 --> 00:15:05,412
克莱尔
Claire!

385
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:10,580
你在干什么
What are you doing?

386
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,300
我正在努力挖出真相
I am trying to get to the truth.

387
00:15:12,333 --> 00:15:14,443
搞清家里到底发生什么的唯一办法
The only way I'm gonna find out what really happened here

388
00:15:14,443 --> 00:15:16,153
就是让那两个熊孩子互相揭发
is to get those two clowns to turn on each other.

389
00:15:16,153 --> 00:15:17,713
家里什么事都没有
Nothing happened here!

390
00:15:17,713 --> 00:15:18,883
就算真的有
And even if it had,

391
00:15:18,883 --> 00:15:21,493
曼尼也不会出卖他最好的朋友
Manny's not gonna rat out his best friend!

392
00:15:22,053 --> 00:15:23,483
我想我要乖乖跟她合作了
I think I'm gonna take the deal.

393
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:24,200
不行
No!

394
00:15:24,594 --> 00:15:26,004
你要是认怂 我们跟交换留学生
You cave, we don't stand a chance

395
00:15:26,004 --> 00:15:27,334
就没机会了
with those exchange students.

396
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:29,600
那些姑娘看不上弱爆的
Those girls don't respect weak, little nerds

397
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:31,140
害怕妈咪惩罚的小书呆子
afraid of being punished by their mommies.

398
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,640
她们经历过战争
They've lived through wars.

399
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,180
她们是从葡萄牙来的
They're from Portugal!

400
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,380
我听见有动静
I heard something.

401
00:15:38,460 --> 00:15:39,200
你听见了吗
Did you hear something?

402
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,260
没
No.

403
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,900
我现在在尖叫吗
Am I screaming right now?

404
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:46,660
没有
No.

405
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:50,040
保持镇定 我们就快离开这了
Stay cool. We're almost out of here.

406
00:15:54,235 --> 00:15:55,055
这没人
All clear.

407
00:15:55,805 --> 00:15:56,815
我们检查下卢克的房间
Let's just check Luke's room.

408
00:15:56,815 --> 00:15:59,126
然后就可以告诉克莱尔我们什么都没发现
Then we can tell Claire we didn't find anything.

409
00:16:06,906 --> 00:16:08,546
好吧 我们有两个办法
Okay, there's two ways we can play this.

410
00:16:08,546 --> 00:16:09,086
好的
Okay.

411
00:16:11,696 --> 00:16:13,256
好吧 如果我们告诉克莱尔这些孩子的事
Okay, if we tell Claire about those kids,

412
00:16:13,256 --> 00:16:14,927
那就得留在这儿惩罚曼尼
we're gonna have to stay here and punish Manny

413
00:16:14,927 --> 00:16:16,817
以及 那个谁
and the, uh -- the other one.

414
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:18,320
那可不妙
That's no good!

415
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:21,320
我觉得那样就瞒不住我们的罪过了
I don't think we can hide our crime!

416
00:16:21,797 --> 00:16:22,917
如果我们不告诉她呢
Well, then what if we don't tell her?

417
00:16:22,917 --> 00:16:24,187
那样我们就成了坏家长吗
Does -- Does that make us bad parents?

418
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,240
或者说我们是坏家长
Or are we bad parents,

419
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:27,100
是因为我们自己都嗑嗨了 却还要惩罚孩子们
because we're punishing our kids while we are high?

420
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,500
无论哪样 我们都坏得透透的
We're bad parents either way!

421
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:29,400
真是个噩梦
This is a nightmare.

422
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:31,460
-你们好啊 -你好 小蛋糕
- Oh, hey, guys. - Hey, cupcake!

423
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:33,320
我刚是叫她"小蛋糕"吗
Do I call her "Cupcake"?

424
00:16:33,418 --> 00:16:34,478
别担心 我来化解尴尬
Don't worry, I'll make it normal.

425
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:35,920
怎么了 小蛋糕
What's going on, cupcake?

426
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:38,560
你俩还好吗
Are you guys okay?

427
00:16:39,408 --> 00:16:41,118
好 好 好的很 怎么会不好
Yeah. Yeah, we're okay. Why wouldn't we be okay?

428
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:41,660
小蛋糕
Cupcake.

429
00:16:42,860 --> 00:16:45,180
我当时醉得一塌糊涂 以为他俩嗑高了
I was so drunk, I thought they were stoned.

430
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:49,520
卢克 卢克 卢克
Luke...Luke...Luke.

431
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:53,080
保守秘密是很不好受的
Keeping a secret like this is tough --

432
00:16:53,389 --> 00:16:55,149
会吞噬掉一个人的灵魂
eats away at a man's soul.

433
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,320
妈妈 我只有一个问题
Mom, I have one question --

434
00:16:58,180 --> 00:16:59,460
你为什么憎恨自己
Why do you hate yourself?

435
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:00,160
什么
What?

436
00:17:00,309 --> 00:17:03,409
你晚上本可以尽情地享受高级奢华的按摩
You have one night in a spa to be massaged and pampered,

437
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:05,360
但你却情愿留在这
but you're here.

438
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:07,380
你为什么觉得自己不配得到快乐
Why don't you think you deserve happiness?

439
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,800
这是我今天想深入解决的谜团
That's the mystery I'm interested in solving today.

440
00:17:11,980 --> 00:17:13,060
什么声音
What is that?

441
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:17,690
那是派对的声音 歌洛莉亚 对吧
That is the sound of a party, Gloria, huh?

442
00:17:17,690 --> 00:17:19,820
曼尼
Ay, Manny!

443
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:24,091
明天我和我妈去上母子曼波舞课一定尴尬到爆
Tomorrow's gonna be one awkward mother/son mambo class.

444
00:17:27,091 --> 00:17:28,631
接下来 我要打你老娘的屁股
Next up, I paddle your mother.

445
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:30,720
-爸爸 -克莱尔
- Dad. - Claire!

446
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,800
嘿 这才是我真正的女儿
Hey, this is my actual daughter.

447
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,200
今晚好几次提到了你
You came up a few times tonight.

448
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,240
我"老婆"也是
So has my "wife."

449
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,720
你们在这搞什么鬼
What are you doing here?

450
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:38,660
我们在酒吧 游戏都玩遍了
We ran out of games to bet on at the bar.

451
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:42,440
克莱尔 有些事我们得告诉你
Claire...there's something we have to tell you.

452
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:45,260
我们决定做什么来着
What did we decide to do again?

453
00:17:45,832 --> 00:17:46,752
我们...
We, uh...

454
00:17:47,892 --> 00:17:49,422
我们...我们要组织下语言
We're g-- We're gonna need a minute.

455
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:52,760
我告诉过你 孩子们没犯事
I told you there was nothing going on with the boys.

456
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:54,640
你说得对
You're right.

457
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:57,240
孩子们 我道歉
Boys, I apologize.

458
00:17:57,520 --> 00:18:00,560
我们以人格担保 没有任何可疑情况
We can confirm that there's nothing suspicious anywhere.

459
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:09,120
很抱歉砸坏了你的桌子 路易斯
Sorry about your table, Lewis.

460
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:10,640
我还要赶另一个派对
I have another party.

461
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:14,960
我就知道
Oh, I knew it!

462
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:16,960
我就知道这俩小子在密谋着什么
I knew these two were up to something.

463
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,960
现在你要怎么为你的"妈宝"曼尼辩护
What do you think about your precious Manny now, huh?

464
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:20,720
我相信一定是卢克的主意
I am sure it was Luke's idea!

465
00:18:20,980 --> 00:18:22,840
但先别急着放弃他
But do not give up on him yet.

466
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:25,040
我知道山上面有个营地
I know that there is a camp up in the mountains

467
00:18:25,124 --> 00:18:26,134
专门收容这种坏小孩
where you can send bad kids.

468
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:28,520
不 我也是共犯
No, it was my idea, too.

469
00:18:28,760 --> 00:18:30,300
是我触发烟雾报警器的
I'm the one who set off the smoke alarm.

470
00:18:30,420 --> 00:18:32,040
是我用汽水贿赂莉莉的
I'm the one who bribed Lily with soda.

471
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:34,460
是我在洗衣房放了一个红色电灯泡
I'm the one who put a red light bulb in the laundry room

472
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:35,600
来营造性感的气氛
to give it a sexy vibe.

473
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:39,000
你不能再固执地认为我还是你的乖宝宝
You've got to stop thinking of me as your perfect little boy.

474
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:40,120
亲爱的
Honey.

475
00:18:42,115 --> 00:18:44,295
-楼上有个派对 -楼上有派对
- There's a party upstairs. - Party upstairs.

476
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:48,960
我真不敢相信我家宝贝竟然对我撒谎了
I cannot believe that my baby lied to me.

477
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:51,320
我真不敢相信我家宝贝坦然受贿
I cannot believe my baby accepted a bribe.

478
00:18:51,466 --> 00:18:53,616
要是我就会将关注点放在
I'd be more concerned with how natural she is

479
00:18:53,616 --> 00:18:55,616
-她浑然天成的喝酒姿势 -够了
- with that bottle in her hands. - Okay.

480
00:18:55,856 --> 00:18:58,116
我真不该太相信自己的孩子
I shouldn't trust my kid so much.

481
00:18:58,136 --> 00:19:01,486
我应该像克莱尔那样 不信任任何人
I have to be more like Claire and not trust anybody.

482
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,560
我也不希望我猜对了 但事实如此
I didn't want to be right, but I am.

483
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:05,260
于是就这结果了
So here we are.

484
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,740
至少我们还有艾丽克斯
At least we still have Alex.

485
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,500
你们连一个好孩子都没培养出来
You guys don't have any good kids,

486
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:10,520
所以现在谁是坏家长
so who's the bad parent now, huh?

487
00:19:10,637 --> 00:19:12,087
-谁都不是 -菲尔 别说
- Nobody. - Phil, no, don't.

488
00:19:12,087 --> 00:19:13,457
不 我来处理
No, no. I got this.

489
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:16,940
克莱尔 我知道为什么你一直担心
Claire, I know why you're always worried.

490
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:19,720
因为你不知道未来会发生什么
Because you don't know what's going to happen.

491
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:21,480
那叫"未知恐惧"
It's called fear of the future,

492
00:19:22,188 --> 00:19:25,508
或"未恐" 或"未惧"
or "Fof" Or "Fotf."

493
00:19:25,908 --> 00:19:29,138
但容我剧透下 一切都会好得很
But spoiler alert -- It's gonna be great.

494
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:32,610
大家 我有俩字要告诉你们
Guys, I have two words for you --

495
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,100
想想"时间旅行"
think about time travel.

496
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:39,100
如果你们能够穿越回到从前
If you could go forward in time and turn around

497
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:41,740
转身看到此时此景 我们会说
and look at this moment, we would say,

498
00:19:42,220 --> 00:19:43,540
"真是太棒了"
"This is all super chill."

499
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:45,940
我们的孩子们都是好人
Our kids are good people.

500
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:48,020
他们长大了很优秀
They turn out great.

501
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:49,540
-菲尔是对的 -真的吗
- Phil's right. - Really?

502
00:19:50,489 --> 00:19:52,349
那...那我也有一些想说的
Oh, t-then here's something, too.

503
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:55,120
我小的时候 我从没想过我还会在这儿
When I was younger, I never thought I would be here.

504
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:57,020
但现在我就在这
And here I am.

505
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,100
这是什么意思
What the hell does that mean?

506
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:00,180
老天
Oh, God.

507
00:20:00,580 --> 00:20:02,200
听着 你不用紧张
Look, you got to relax.

508
00:20:02,360 --> 00:20:03,820
他们不会有事的
They're going to be fine.

509
00:20:04,780 --> 00:20:06,780
人们都有出人意料的一面
People have a way of surprising you.

510
00:20:06,780 --> 00:20:08,970
没错 我们今晚也有难忘的美好经历
Yes, you see, we had our own journey tonight --

511
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:11,840
原本不搭调的两人一起玩得很开心
an unlikely duo thrust together.

512
00:20:11,921 --> 00:20:12,851
没轮到你发言 小卡
Not your moment, Cam.

513
00:20:12,851 --> 00:20:14,631
好吧 我会给你们发群邮的
Oh, right. I'll send a group e-mail.

514
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:16,240
亲爱的 别担心
Honey, don't worry.

515
00:20:16,241 --> 00:20:18,621
你作为家长 远胜过当年的我和迪迪
You're better parents than Dede and I ever were,

516
00:20:18,791 --> 00:20:20,211
你长大了也依然很棒啊
and you turned out all right.

517
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:20,840
谢谢 爸爸
Thanks, Dad.

518
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,600
我们现在该怎么办
But what do we do now?

519
00:20:22,681 --> 00:20:24,251
我们该放过这些孩子们一马吗
Are we just supposed to let these kids off the hook

520
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:25,720
因为我们曾经也和他们一样顽劣
because we were as bad as they are?

521
00:20:25,740 --> 00:20:27,080
不 我们要当伪君子
No. We'll be hypocrites.

522
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:28,420
跟所有家长一样
Like all parents!

523
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:29,480
卢克 曼尼
Luke! Manny!

524
00:20:29,860 --> 00:20:31,220
都给我滚过来
Get your asses in here!

525
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:34,000
还有 只有我一个人看出来
Also, am I the only one that sees

526
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,700
这两个蠢货嗑药嗑得飘飘欲仙了吗
that these two idiots are high as kites?

527
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:38,100
米奇尔
Mitchell?

528
00:20:39,900 --> 00:20:42,180
天哪 她还在跑
Oh, my God. She is still going.

529
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:44,280
她到底喝了多少汽水
How much soda did she have?

530
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:46,180
当你和米奇尔刚在一起时
You know, when you and Mitchell first got together,

531
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:48,160
你经常约我一起参与很多活动
you used to ask me to do a lot of stuff.

532
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:50,000
我当时才刚刚加入你们的家庭 而且
I was new to the family, and I --

533
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:51,820
我非常想博你欢心
I really wanted you to like me.

534
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:55,000
但我总是太急切 太情感外露
But I always seemed to be too much, too demonstrative,

535
00:20:55,140 --> 00:20:57,640
太小题大做 所以我收手了
too dramatic... so I stopped.

536
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,140
今晚我玩的很开心
Well, I had fun tonight.

537
00:20:59,773 --> 00:21:01,264
我不介意你继续时不时地
I wouldn't mind if you still

538
00:21:01,264 --> 00:21:02,984
追在我屁股后面讨好我
chased me a little bit sometimes.

539
00:21:02,994 --> 00:21:04,614
杰 来抱一个
Oh, Jay. Get in here.

540
00:21:04,900 --> 00:21:06,020
有点太快了吧
It's going too fast.

541
00:21:06,204 --> 00:21:06,864
我很抱歉 一步步来
I'm -- I'm sorry. Baby steps.

542
00:21:06,864 --> 00:21:09,144
不是 那个跑步机快得都能让她上天了
No, the treadmill's about to launch her through the drywall.

543
00:21:09,144 --> 00:21:10,624
莉莉
Lily.
